Package: sequencemap
Title: Spatial Mapping of Viral Sequence Variation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "J. M.",
           family = "Humphreys",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "spatial.jmh@gmail.com")
Description: Tools for converting aligned viral sequence data and sampling
    coordinates into ordination-based spatial summaries and predicted surfaces.
    The PCA-first workflow supports alignment quality control, location-level
    score and reduced-space dispersion summaries, and optional Gaussian SPDE
    interpolation through 'INLA'. Raster and polygon outputs are derived
    reporting summaries of modeled ordination-axis surfaces, not direct
    nucleotide-diversity estimates.
